{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Animation｜当前结构与职责\n箭头按调用、继承、持有或数据传递标签阅读。\n原生Slot唯一混合Mesh姿态；CMC唯一执行胶囊XYZ。Animation发布配置并消费语义。\n[[Animation/结构|结构文档]] · [[GGYGO_流程_动画表现.canvas|表现流程]] · [[Animation/动作姿态修正|姿态契约]] · [[GGYGO_流程_动作姿态修正.canvas|姿态子图]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 3580,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "source",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## CMC / ASC / Pawn（权威）\nCMC拥有运动段、time/cycle/alpha、真实轨迹／Yaw及胶囊执行。\nPublish接收原source配置；Retire仅撤原producer/代次。\n原native区间由CMC发布Steering快照；Capture只读事实，ASC提供Tag。\n[[Movement/结构|Movement]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构|GAS]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "capture",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOAnimationStateCapture\nCapture(OutFrame,OutDebug,Pawn)在GT集中取事实。\n原CMC GetLocomotionSteeringSnapshot只取一次；核原CMC／Character，缺必需provider明确Invalid。\n无Character为Captured=false，worker不解析弱来源。",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "frame",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOAnimationStateFrame\n原输入、WalkRunBlendAlpha、StopMotionType、步态、转身、Tag保持。\nbLocomotionSteeringCaptured＋LocomotionSteering承载原native区间值／弱身份。\n无第二方向／区间权威、ABP状态名、资产或Player时间。",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "base",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOAnimInstanceBase\n原Initialize/Update检查Owner与source配置，调用CMC公开sink；配置不变复用binding。\nUninitialize/Owner替换先撤原source代次，再Reset帧/Debug并调用派生Hook。\n持publication handle，不持motion clock或Graph输出。\n语义查询只供ABP读取。",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 620,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "abp",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## ABP_Pyrios\n消费原语义／GaitBlendY，Player／Evaluator／相位保持。\n普通WalkRun单Spine组件空间Additive Pitch，只读Angle／Valid；Translation／Scale Ignore。\nFullBody ActionPoseSlot保Body XYZ，替换原Slot与顶层Bip001全轴平移修正。\nRequired FullBody、Bip001/Root／原对齐由ABP配置，物理／表现不承诺同clock。",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 1060,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "compat",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UZZZAnimInstance / Snapshot\nResolveLocomotionSourceBinding解析本人AnimSet，核真实引用／rate／length／BS样本。\nLegacySnapshotAdapter／MapMovementState复制alpha→GaitBlendY、Stop→StopValue。\n原NativeUpdate随后从同帧Steering＋alpha派生有限倾身，不重判移动资格。\nReset清Memory/Snap/Events及自身倾身／来源键，保AnimSet/Tuning；无运动计时器。",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "data",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FZZZAnimSet / Tuning\n五single route→原序列表；walkRun→实际BS，Loop取BS样本。缺key／asset明确失败。\nWalkRunLean显式Enabled、满倾角速度／Walk／Run最大角／进入恢复响应；Enabled非法值不兜底。\n[[GGYGO_结构_动画曲线.canvas|源引用与算法]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 配置与表现两种接口\nAnimation→CMC：immutable source binding，仅引用/metadata/身份，无曲线副本。\nCMC/ASC→Capture→ABP：只读语义；Graph速度不反馈CMC。\nMissing/Invalid可接收但不授曲线执行；CMC在必需请求拒绝，Fixed/GA不误报。\nOwner/config退休仅清本人旧代次；强资产引用有界，残留快照不授权后继。\n七旧Locomotion DA已解绑/删除/fresh冷读；历史类/工具仍保留。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1490,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_sources",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 普攻 AnimSequence（已存在）\nNormal_01/02/03 与对应 End：60 fps，共用 Pyrios Skeleton。\n无 Notify，原生 Root Motion=false；含 RootMotion_* 曲线。\n[[Animation/普攻动画实施|资产事实与契约]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1920,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_montages",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 三份普攻 Montage（初版已保存）\nMain→完整End→停止，FullBody；Blend时长独立配置。\nActionSignal持唯一stock Montage Notify，Name=Event.Montage.CancelPoint，时点由作者拖动。\n原Hit／Combo／Sound保留。\n[[Animation/普攻动画实施#作者单点信号配置|单点配置]]",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 1920,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_ga",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## PlayerCombo GA（跨模块）\n持原Activation／StepToken／Task与CMC句柄；Main→End共用资源。\nHandleMontageNotify→EnableStepInterruption，GA唯一持门；新播放关闭。\n过点接受合格移动或新攻击，Next1/2/0；无请求等两完成事实自然End。\n[[计划_玩家普攻连段|GA生命周期]]",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 2100,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_notify",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Montage单点与窗口\nstock点→Task.NotifyReceived：原Montage／Mesh／int32实例ID／Name／Trigger事实。\nGA核原资源后持门；Notify不持玩法状态。\nGameplayEventWindow另发Hit／Combo事件，不授打断门。\n[[Animation/普攻动画实施#作者单点信号配置|作者操作]]",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 2380,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_slot_gate",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 已保存的FullBody主图\n状态机→ActionPoseSlot→原LocalToCS→原CSToLocal→原Inertialization→Root。\n退役旧Slot及顶层Bip001全轴Translation Replace；保AlwaysUpdateSourcePose=true、原对齐Z=50.8019981384／Required FullBody。\nGate106只改普通WalkRun单Spine支路；主图及另24图保持。\n[[Animation/动作姿态修正|实际配置与分责]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2380,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "bh3_import",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2890,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 310,
      "text": "## BH3 Kevin DemonBattle：独立导入\n模型/StandBy已保存与预览；75条可导入动画全部成功，4条源空片段未生成。\n独立Skeleton，保留原始根层级；渲染按槽名接线。\n[[Animation/BH3_Kevin_DemonBattle导入|导入说明与验收]]\n[[GGYGO_流程_BH3_DemonBattle导入.canvas|导入流程子图]]",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "kevin_combat",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3340,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Kevin战斗动画（资产待生成）\n55独立Montage；Ice01/02候选窗口；Prop1端点与独立ABP。\n已有资产只读核验，缺失才创建；Movement提供InPlace并执行位移。\n完整链接与3项Animation安全自动化通过；生产资产及玩法待验收。\n[[Animation/资产生产安全|保护契约]] · [[Animation/Kevin战斗动画实施|实施]] · [[GGYGO_流程_Kevin战斗动画.canvas|生成流程]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "montage_guard",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": 560,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## UGGYGOMontageGuardAnimInstance\nBase继承的原生播放屏障；引擎执行Montage。\n仅借用ScopeChain，保原生命周期身份；旧Scope只注销本人登记。\nNativeUpdateAnimation在GT检查真实Montage输入，向原节点发布能力与native counter。\n提供只读Acquire/Poll；不持GAS状态或CMC执行权。\n[[Animation/结构|Guard与姿态接口]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "montage_scope",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": 1120,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 440,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## FGGYGOMontagePlayGuardScope\nCaller栈拥有、不可复制/移动；原Guard仅借用登记。\nRequest：OriginalAnimInstance、RequestedMontage、CallerIdentity、IsCallerContextCurrent（原有纯上下文谓词）。\nCanExecute仅准许原生入口；Complete(CallerReturn)封存，GetResult返回Scope内引用，析构前必须复制。\nResult：Identity/Outcome/NativeStage/两返回值；bSealed与NativeStage分开。\n析构只注销原实例自身登记，不停Montage、不清ASC/Task状态。\n没有第二播放执行器/全局attempt表/计时器。"
    },
    {
      "id": "montage_guard_query",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2720,
      "y": 560,
      "width": 860,
      "height": 550,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## Guard只读阶段查询\nTryGetCurrentMontagePlayGuardStage(CallerIdentity,OutNativeStage,bOutCompleted)\nGT只看最内层原登记/身份；false先Reset。\n无祖先替代、外部谓词或生命周期刷新；外调后重查。\nReturned/Completed只代表原生返回/Scope封存，不授Task/GA资源权限。\n[[Animation/结构#Montage播放Guard的静态契约|查询边界]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "montage_callers",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": 1740,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 490,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## ASC / Montage Task（跨模块）\nASC完整Super播放并复制Guard结果；GAS持原播放状态。\nTask管理原Handle／Guard／scale与精确订阅。\nConfigureOriginalMontageNotify→原OnPlayMontageNotifyBegin→NotifyReceived强身份事实；TryGetOriginalMontageNotifySnapshot只读原实例／点。\nRequired-only Tick Poll；失败清原资源后OnFailed。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构|原Task接口]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "source_binding",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Source binding（native DTO）\nIdentity：原Producer/Character/Mesh、lifecycle/config代次。\n强Sequence/BS引用＋loop/rate/length/样本位置；无曲线副本、Graph状态或clock。\nStatus/Error明确；当前binding与原SavedMove有界保留，失效不能授权后继。\n[[Animation/曲线处理#1. 当前职责与依赖方向|发布与退休]]",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": 2500,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "action_pose_slot",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOAnimNode_ActionPoseSlot\n原生Slot唯一Update／Evaluate／权重／Notify混合。\n输入Source／Slot、Body／Trajectory和ComponentAlignment。\nPostEvaluateSourcePose借同次参与Source XYZ向量；Evaluate只写Body local translation。\nCheckCapability／ValidateMontageCapability发布能力／诊断。\nepoch／failureSerial是派生状态，Editor包装序列化Node。\n[[Animation/动作姿态修正|向量算法]]",
      "x": 2720,
      "y": 1250,
      "width": 860,
      "height": 540,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "action_pose_contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Guard能力接口 / 原票据\nAcquireActionPoseContract(原Montage)→ExplicitNotRequired/RequiredReady/Rejected/Unavailable。\nGT原并行完成屏障后读取原compiled node；不强制Evaluate。\nPollActionPoseContract(原ticket)→Valid/Failed/Invalidated；不刷新旧票据。\nFGGYGOActionPoseContractTicket持原provider/Mesh/模型/Montage弱身份、node key/Slot、生命周期/epoch/故障基线。\n无native instance/pose/clock，Task销毁Reset。\n[[GGYGO_流程_动作姿态修正.canvas|触发、故障与清理]]",
      "x": 2720,
      "y": 1880,
      "width": 860,
      "height": 550,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "action_pose_boundary",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Mesh姿态 / CMC胶囊 / 验证\nBody相对Trajectory的XYZ余量归姿态节点，原Slot输出接Inertialization。\nPosXYZ区间／clock／物理归CMC，node/provider不写速度或输入权限。\nTask管原播放／scale，GA等两完成事实并清自己原资源。\n[[Animation/动作姿态修正|职责边界]] · [[Movement/结构|CMC]]",
      "x": 2720,
      "y": 2540,
      "width": 860,
      "height": 450,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "action_motion_binding",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOActionMotionSourceBinding\nBuildSourceBindingRange(原Montage,Slot,Main,End)→真实Sections／原Segment只读配置。\nValidateSourceBinding核原身份；MapMontageInterval分原源／loop区间。\nResolveMappedSegmentEnd只认有来源的最后端点量化，原raw GetEndPos保留，内段gap／overlap拒绝。\n不读曲线／推进clock／签播放权限，GA／CMC／RMS／有界SavedMove持引用。\n[[Movement/动作曲线执行|原求值与执行]]",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": 3060,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 430,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "steering_snapshot",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Movement｜原完成区间快照\nFGGYGOLocomotionSteeringSnapshot／GT GetLocomotionSteeringSnapshot() const。\n原CMC／Character／UpdatedComponent弱身份＋SourceEpoch、完成Serial／Frame／native dt。\nInitial／Valid／NotApplicable／Invalid与Diagnostic归CMC；合法原初始化等待和明确无效依赖分开。\nActualSignedVelocityYawRate＋有效导数标志描述真实速度轨迹；ActualSignedYawRate描述胶囊Yaw，不混用。\n[[Animation/结构#WalkRun倾身：原区间事实与普通分支|共享接口与清理]]",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": 3600,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "walkrun_lean",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UZZZ｜有限WalkRun倾身\nUpdateWalkRunLeanPresentation(原AnimDelta)消费同帧原DTO／alpha；不读worker对象、不重判资格。\n只持原弱CMC／Epoch、一个有限滤波角与诊断去重。\nWalkRunLeanAngleDegrees／bWalkRunLeanPresentationValid／WalkRunLeanFailureReason是Transient只读表现。\n原来源／Epoch变化、Lifecycle Reset清本人资源；Initial等待、无观察恢复、Invalid清角＋定位诊断。\nABP拥有骨轴／空间；180deg/s、Walk2°、Run6°、进入12／恢复8。\n[[Animation/计划_动画与表现层#WalkRun运动偏移（2026-10-07，Gate106）|Gate106有限证据]]",
      "x": 2720,
      "y": 3600,
      "width": 860,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "5"
    }
  ],
